PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:ManifestationFormat a logic:AbstractIndividualType , owl:Class ;
        rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:ManifestationFormat MUST be an owl:Class typed logic:AbstractIndividualType and a subclass of logic:QualityValue -- an open value vocabulary of format individuals, never subclasses (Principle 9)." .

